#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid ""
"Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP"
" associations from the database and their re-creation based on <strong>All "
"scanned data</strong> now."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort alla <strong>aggregerade</strong> kopplingar mellan portar, MAC-"
"adresser och IP-adresser från databasen, men inte skanningsresultaten, och "
"återskapar dem direkt utifrån <strong>alla skanningsdata</strong>."
